/**
 * @file src/AnalysisG/modules/nusol/ellipse/include/ellipse/mtx.h
 * @brief Robust double-precision matrix manipulation class for the ellipse module.
 *
 * The `mtx` class allows for matrix arithmetic, transposition, inversion, determinants, 
 * eigenvalues, eigenvectors, and custom matrix generation functions necessary for 
 * solving kinematic reconstruction geometries.
 *
 * @class mtx
 * @brief Multi-dimensional double precision matrix wrapper.
 *
 * @fn mtx::mtx(int idx, int idy)
 * @brief Constructs a zero-initialized matrix of dimensions `idx` by `idy`.
 *
 * @fn double mtx::trace()
 * @brief Computes the matrix trace.
 *
 * @fn double mtx::det()
 * @brief Computes the matrix determinant.
 *
 * @fn mtx* mtx::eigenvalues()
 * @brief Computes and returns the eigenvalues of the matrix.
 *
 * @fn mtx* mtx::eigenvector()
 * @brief Computes and returns the eigenvectors corresponding to the matrix.
 *
 * @fn mtx mtx::T()
 * @brief Returns the transposed matrix.
 *
 * @fn mtx mtx::inv()
 * @brief Returns the inverse of the matrix.
 *
 * @fn mtx mtx::cross(mtx* r1)
 * @brief Computes the cross product of this matrix and r1.
 */
